// Chapter VII, Finance (第七章 財政), Articles 83-91: the fiscal power and the
// Diet, taxation, expenditure and obligations, the budget, the reserve fund, the
// property and expenses of the Imperial House, the ban on public funds for religious
// bodies and for private charitable/educational/benevolent enterprises, the audit of
// the final accounts, and the report on the finances of the State.
//
// MODEL
//   * ARTICLES 83, 84, 85 and 89 are BANS addressed to the organs of the State:
//     `prohibition` (bearer = the organ, action = the act). The premise names the
//     act and the bearer and holds only where the lawful basis is NOT known
//     (`not_known`): an act that has its basis stays outside the ban, and the position
//     appears only where it can matter (as in Art. 8 of ch01). The lawful basis is
//     always a POSITIVE predicate: a resolution of the Diet (`diet_resolution`, the
//     public producer of ch04c), an enacted statute (`enacted_as_law`, ch04c). The act
//     itself is established by a fact of the case (VIOLATED on itself, ACTIVE otherwise).
//   * ARTICLE 83 is the general principle (every exercise of the fiscal power of the
//     State rests on a resolution of the Diet); Arts. 84 (taxes) and 85 (expenditure and
//     obligations) are its two specific bans. An act that falls under Art. 85 falls under
//     Art. 83 as well: two positions, both established from the same act.
//   * ARTICLE 84. A new tax or a change of an existing one requires a statute or the
//     conditions fixed by a statute (法律又は法律の定める条件による). Two positive routes to
//     the basis: the measure is laid by an enacted statute, or under the conditions of an
//     enacted statute. The CONTENT of the tax statutes is external and is not modelled.
//   * ARTICLE 86. A duty of the Cabinet for EACH fiscal year: prepare the budget, submit
//     it to the Diet, undergo its deliberation and obtain its resolution. The text sets
//     no date. A fiscal year is data of the case (`fiscal_year_span`; its dates are set by
//     a statute outside the Constitution and are not invented). WINDOW (judgment call):
//     from the entry into force of the Constitution to the last day of the fiscal year: the
//     text fixes no opening day, and the fiscal year is the only bound the text itself
//     supplies (a budget cannot be resolved "for" a fiscal year that is over). Silence
//     after the window is UNDETERMINED; the breach is an ASSERTED negation (§113).
//   * ARTICLE 87. (1) The Diet MAY resolve a reserve fund to cover an unforeseeable
//     shortfall of the budget (a power of the Diet, valid only if the shortfall is such
//     that it could not be foreseen: 予見し難い is an EVALUATIVE element, channel 1 of
//     DECISION-0194: judgment relation, the authority is the Diet, which decides it by
//     the very resolution the text requires; a modelling choice, no primary source
//     asserts anything about it) and the Cabinet MAY spend the fund on its own
//     responsibility (a liberty of the Cabinet). (2) EVERY expenditure of the reserve is
//     followed by a duty of the Cabinet to obtain the Diet's approval AFTER it; the text
//     names no term, the window is open (from the day of expenditure). The approval
//     satisfies the duty only when it is not earlier than the expenditure (事後に).
//   * ARTICLE 88. The property of the Imperial House belongs to the State (a derivation)
//     and every expense of the Imperial House must be entered in the budget and pass the
//     resolution of the Diet (a duty of the Cabinet, the budget-maker of Art. 86). The
//     gifts and transfers of property are Art. 8 in ch01 and are NOT duplicated here.
//   * ARTICLE 89. Two bans on the disposal of public funds or other public property:
//     (a) for the use, benefit or maintenance of a religious organization or body;
//     (b) for a charitable, educational or benevolent enterprise that is NOT under public
//     control. The exception is a POSITIVE predicate (`under_public_control`): the
//     enterprise is under public control when the case says so. 公の支配 is EVALUATIVE
//     (channel 2 of DECISION-0194: the text names no decider, so the classification is a
//     fact of a court or organ, `origin adjudicated`); the readings of the Government and
//     of the courts are NOT asserted (no primary source retrieved:
//     coverage/J8-interpretations.md). Whether a body is religious is also a fact.
//   * ARTICLE 90. The final accounts of the State are inspected EVERY YEAR by the Board of
//     Audit (a duty of the Board, window from the day after the fiscal year to the last
//     day of the following fiscal year: the Cabinet must submit the report with them in
//     that year, so an inspection later than that is of no use to the text: judgment
//     call) and the Cabinet submits them, with the audit report, to the Diet IN THE NEXT
//     fiscal year (a duty of the Cabinet, window = the following fiscal year). Paragraph 2
//     (organization and powers of the Board of Audit by statute) is an external contract.
//   * ARTICLE 91. The Cabinet reports on the finances of the State to the Diet and to the
//     people periodically, at least once a year. A report made on the day d starts a year:
//     the next report is due by `add_calendar_period(d, 1 calendar_year)` (the anniversary
//     day is inside, judgment call; 29 February goes to the last day of February under the
//     month-end convention of DIET_CALENDAR_STEP of ch04a). The chain starts from an
//     observed report; the text sets no day of the FIRST report and none is invented.
//     One duty is stated for the Diet and one for the people (two addressees named).
//
// Public producers for other stages: fiscal_act_based_on_diet_resolution(a),
// tax_authorized_by_law(t), reserve_fund_established(rf), budget_process_complete(fy),
// state_property(x), final_accounts_properly_submitted(a), finance_report_due(d, due).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package jp.constitution version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:jp:constitution:clir";

use self::{
    Cabinet,
    Diet,
    JP_CONST_ART83_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART84_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART85_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART86_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART87_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART87_P2,
    JP_CONST_ART88_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART89_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART90_P1,
    JP_CONST_ART90_P2,
    JP_CONST_ART91_P1,
    Organ,
    Proposal,
    ProposalKind,
    diet_resolution,
    law_in_force,
    proposal_kind,
};

entity FiscalAct { label ja official "国の財政を処理する権限の行使"; label en unofficial "an exercise of the fiscal power of the State"; }
entity TaxMeasure { label ja official "新たに租税を課し、又は現行の租税を変更すること"; label en unofficial "a measure that imposes a new tax or changes an existing tax"; }
entity FiscalYear { label ja official "会計年度"; label en unofficial "a fiscal year"; }
entity ReserveFund { label ja official "予備費"; label en unofficial "a reserve fund"; }
entity ReserveExpenditure { label ja official "予備費の支出"; label en unofficial "an expenditure of the reserve fund"; }
entity ImperialHouseExpense { label ja official "皇室の費用"; label en unofficial "an expense of the Imperial House"; }
entity ImperialHouseProperty { label ja official "皇室財産"; label en unofficial "a property of the Imperial House"; }
entity PublicDisposition : FiscalAct { label ja official "公金その他の公の財産の支出又は利用に供すること"; label en unofficial "a disbursement of public money or a making available of other public property"; }
entity Beneficiary { label ja official "支出又は利用の相手方"; label en unofficial "a body or enterprise that receives a public disposition"; }
entity FinalAccounts { label ja official "国の収入支出の決算"; label en unofficial "the final accounts of the revenue and expenditure of the State"; }
entity FinanceReport { label ja official "国の財政状況についての報告"; label en unofficial "a report on the financial condition of the State"; }
entity Public { label ja official "国民"; label en unofficial "the people, the addressee of a report of Art. 91"; }

const BoardOfAudit: Organ = entity_ref("urn:jp:constitution:clir#BoardOfAudit") {
    label ja official "会計検査院";
    label en unofficial "the Board of Audit";
};
const ThePeople: Public = entity_ref("urn:jp:constitution:clir#ThePeople") {
    label ja official "国民";
    label en unofficial "the people";
};

// --- Shared: fiscal years, the budget, the basis of an act -----------------------
relation fiscal_year_span(fy: FiscalYear, first: Date, last: Date) kind empirical {
    key(fy);
    label ja official "会計年度";
    label en unofficial "the fiscal year runs from the first to the last day (the dates are set by a statute outside the Constitution: an input, not invented)";
}
relation following_fiscal_year(fy: FiscalYear, next: FiscalYear) kind empirical {
    label ja official "次の年度";
    label en unofficial "the next fiscal year after the fiscal year";
}
relation budget_for_year(b: Proposal, fy: FiscalYear) kind empirical {
    label ja official "毎会計年度の予算";
    label en unofficial "the proposal is the budget for the fiscal year";
}
relation cabinet_prepared_budget(b: Proposal) kind empirical {
    label ja official "予算を作成し";
    label en unofficial "the Cabinet prepared the budget";
}
relation cabinet_submitted_budget_to_diet(b: Proposal) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国会に提出して";
    label en unofficial "the Cabinet submitted the budget to the Diet";
}
relation budget_process_complete(fy: FiscalYear) kind institutional {
    label ja official "予算を作成し、国会に提出して、その審議を受け議決を経た";
    label en unofficial "the budget for the fiscal year was prepared and submitted by the Cabinet and the Diet resolved on it (Art. 86 achieved)";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART86_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "予算を作成し、国会に提出して、その審議を受け議決を経なければならない")
rule BudgetProcessCompleteForYear strict {
    label en unofficial "Article 86. The process of the fiscal year is complete when the budget of that year was prepared, submitted, and resolved by the Diet (diet_resolution of ch04c)";
    for b: Proposal; for fy: FiscalYear;
    when budget_for_year(b, fy) and proposal_kind(b, pk_budget) and cabinet_prepared_budget(b)
        and cabinet_submitted_budget_to_diet(b) and diet_resolution(b);
    then budget_process_complete(fy);
}

// The basis of an act: a resolution of the Diet on a proposal that covers it.
relation act_covered_by_resolution(a: FiscalAct, r: Proposal) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国会の議決に基く";
    label en unofficial "the act rests on the proposal (budget, reserve fund, obligation) on which the Diet has resolved";
}
relation fiscal_act_based_on_diet_resolution(a: FiscalAct) kind institutional {
    label ja official "国会の議決に基く";
    label en unofficial "the act rests on a resolution of the Diet (producer: the resolution exists, ch04c diet_resolution)";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART83_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "国会の議決に基いて")
rule ActBasedOnDietResolution strict {
    label en unofficial "A fiscal act is based on a Diet resolution when it is covered by a resolution of the Diet";
    for a: FiscalAct; for r: Proposal;
    when act_covered_by_resolution(a, r) and diet_resolution(r);
    then fiscal_act_based_on_diet_resolution(a);
}

// --- Article 83 -------------------------------------------------------------------
relation fiscal_act_of(a: FiscalAct, o: Organ) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国の財政を処理する権限";
    label en unofficial "the act belongs to the exercise of the fiscal power of the State by the organ";
}
relation exercises_fiscal_power(o: Organ, a: FiscalAct) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国の財政を処理する権限を行使する";
    label en unofficial "the organ exercises the fiscal power by the act (the action)";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART83_P1)
rule FiscalPowerOnlyOnDietResolution strict {
    label ja official "国の財政を処理する権限は、国会の議決に基いて、これを行使しなければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 83. The power to administer national finances is to be exercised only upon a resolution of the Diet: a ban on exercising it without such a basis";
    for o: Organ; for a: FiscalAct;
    when fiscal_act_of(a, o) and not_known(fiscal_act_based_on_diet_resolution(a));
    then prohibition NoFiscalActWithoutDietResolution {
        bearer o;
        action exercises_fiscal_power(o, a);
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

// --- Article 84 -------------------------------------------------------------------
relation tax_measure_of(t: TaxMeasure, o: Organ) kind empirical {
    label ja official "租税を課し、又は変更する機関";
    label en unofficial "the organ lays the tax or changes it (binds the bearer)";
}
relation imposes_or_changes_tax(o: Organ, t: TaxMeasure) kind empirical {
    label ja official "あらたに租税を課し、又は現行の租税を変更する";
    label en unofficial "the organ imposes a new tax or changes an existing one (the action)";
}
relation tax_laid_by_statute(t: TaxMeasure, l: Proposal) kind empirical {
    label ja official "法律による";
    label en unofficial "the tax measure is laid down by the statute";
}
relation tax_laid_on_statutory_conditions(t: TaxMeasure, l: Proposal) kind empirical {
    label ja official "法律の定める条件による";
    label en unofficial "the tax measure is taken on the conditions fixed by the statute";
}
relation tax_authorized_by_law(t: TaxMeasure) kind institutional {
    label ja official "法律又は法律の定める条件による";
    label en unofficial "the tax measure rests on an enacted statute or on the conditions of an enacted statute";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART84_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "法律")
rule TaxByEnactedStatute strict {
    label en unofficial "A tax laid by an enacted statute in force is authorized by law";
    for t: TaxMeasure; for l: Proposal;
    when tax_laid_by_statute(t, l) and law_in_force(l);
    then tax_authorized_by_law(t);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART84_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "法律の定める条件による")
rule TaxOnConditionsOfEnactedStatute strict {
    label en unofficial "A tax laid on the conditions of an enacted statute in force is authorized by law";
    for t: TaxMeasure; for l: Proposal;
    when tax_laid_on_statutory_conditions(t, l) and law_in_force(l);
    then tax_authorized_by_law(t);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART84_P1)
rule TaxRequiresStatute strict {
    label ja official "あらたに租税を課し、又は現行の租税を変更するには、法律又は法律の定める条件によることを必要とする";
    label en unofficial "Article 84. A new tax may be imposed, or an existing tax changed, only by a statute or on the conditions of a statute";
    for o: Organ; for t: TaxMeasure;
    when tax_measure_of(t, o) and not_known(tax_authorized_by_law(t));
    then prohibition NoTaxWithoutLaw {
        bearer o;
        action imposes_or_changes_tax(o, t);
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

// --- Article 85 -------------------------------------------------------------------
relation state_expenditure_or_obligation_of(a: FiscalAct, o: Organ) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国費の支出又は国の債務の負担";
    label en unofficial "the act is an expenditure of national funds or an assumption of an obligation by the State, by the organ (binds the bearer)";
}
relation spends_or_incurs_obligation(o: Organ, a: FiscalAct) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国費を支出し、又は国が債務を負担する";
    label en unofficial "the organ spends national funds or binds the State by an obligation (the action)";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART85_P1)
rule ExpenditureRequiresDietResolution strict {
    label ja official "国費を支出し、又は国が債務を負担するには、国会の議決に基くことを必要とする";
    label en unofficial "Article 85. National funds may be spent, and the State may assume an obligation, only on the basis of a resolution of the Diet";
    for o: Organ; for a: FiscalAct;
    when state_expenditure_or_obligation_of(a, o) and not_known(fiscal_act_based_on_diet_resolution(a));
    then prohibition NoExpenditureOrObligationWithoutDietResolution {
        bearer o;
        action spends_or_incurs_obligation(o, a);
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

// --- Article 86: the budget -------------------------------------------------------
@source(JP_CONST_ART86_P1)
rule CabinetMustPrepareSubmitAndObtainBudget strict {
    label ja official "内閣は、毎会計年度の予算を作成し、国会に提出して、その審議を受け議決を経なければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 86. The Cabinet prepares and submits to the Diet the budget of every fiscal year and obtains its deliberation and resolution";
    for fy: FiscalYear; for f: Date; for l: Date;
    when fiscal_year_span(fy, f, l);
    then duty CabinetBudgetForFiscalYear {
        bearer Cabinet; beneficiary Diet;
        goal achievement {
            condition budget_process_complete(fy);
            window [@1947-05-03, l];
        }
    };
}

// --- Article 87: the reserve fund -------------------------------------------------
external judgment relation shortfall_unforeseeable(rf: ReserveFund) {
    authority Diet;
    label ja official "予見し難い予算の不足";
    label en unofficial "the shortfall of the budget the fund is to cover is hard to foresee (judgment of the Diet, which resolves the fund; modelling choice)";
}
relation reserve_fund_proposed(rf: ReserveFund) kind empirical {
    label ja official "予備費を設ける";
    label en unofficial "a reserve fund is proposed to the Diet";
}
relation diet_resolves_reserve_fund(rf: ReserveFund) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国会の議決に基いて予備費を設け";
    label en unofficial "the Diet resolves the reserve fund (the act of exercise)";
}
relation reserve_fund_established(rf: ReserveFund) kind institutional {
    label ja official "予備費";
    label en unofficial "the reserve fund is established (producer: the Cabinet may spend it)";
}
relation reserve_expenditure_of(x: ReserveExpenditure, rf: ReserveFund, d: Date) kind empirical {
    key(x);
    label ja official "予備費の支出";
    label en unofficial "the expenditure x of the reserve fund rf was made on the day d";
}
relation cabinet_spends_reserve(x: ReserveExpenditure) kind empirical {
    label ja official "内閣の責任でこれを支出する";
    label en unofficial "the Cabinet spends the reserve on its own responsibility (the action)";
}
relation diet_approval_of(x: ReserveExpenditure, d: Date) kind empirical {
    key(x);
    label ja official "事後に国会の承諾を得る";
    label en unofficial "the Diet gave its approval of the expenditure on the day d";
}
relation diet_approved_after_the_fact(x: ReserveExpenditure) kind institutional {
    label ja official "事後に国会の承諾を得た";
    label en unofficial "the Diet's approval of the expenditure was given on or after the day of the expenditure";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART87_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "予見し難い予算の不足に充てるため、国会の議決に基いて予備費を設け")
rule DietMayResolveReserveFund strict {
    label ja official "予見し難い予算の不足に充てるため、国会の議決に基いて予備費を設け";
    label en unofficial "Article 87(1). To meet an unforeseeable shortfall of the budget the Diet may resolve a reserve fund";
    for rf: ReserveFund;
    when reserve_fund_proposed(rf);
    then power DietEstablishesReserveFund {
        holder Diet; over rf;
        exercise diet_resolves_reserve_fund(rf);
        valid_when shortfall_unforeseeable(rf);
        effect create(reserve_fund_established(rf));
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART87_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "内閣の責任でこれを支出することができる")
rule CabinetMaySpendReserveOnItsOwnResponsibility strict {
    label ja official "内閣の責任でこれを支出することができる";
    label en unofficial "Article 87(1). The Cabinet may spend the established reserve fund on its own responsibility";
    for x: ReserveExpenditure; for rf: ReserveFund; for d: Date;
    when reserve_expenditure_of(x, rf, d) and reserve_fund_established(rf);
    then liberty CabinetSpendsReserve {
        holder Cabinet;
        action cabinet_spends_reserve(x);
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART87_P2, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "事後に国会の承諾を得なければならない")
rule ApprovalAfterTheFactRecognised strict {
    label en unofficial "Diet approval given after the reserve fund expenditure counts as subsequent approval";
    for x: ReserveExpenditure; for e: Date; for a: Date;
    when reserve_expenditure_of(x, _, e) and diet_approval_of(x, a) and a >= e;
    then diet_approved_after_the_fact(x);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART87_P2)
rule CabinetMustObtainApprovalOfEveryReserveExpenditure strict {
    label ja official "すべて予備費の支出については、内閣は、事後に国会の承諾を得なければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 87(2). For every expenditure of the reserve fund the Cabinet must obtain the approval of the Diet afterwards";
    for x: ReserveExpenditure; for rf: ReserveFund; for d: Date;
    when reserve_expenditure_of(x, rf, d);
    then duty CabinetObtainsApprovalOfReserveSpending {
        bearer Cabinet; beneficiary Diet;
        goal achievement {
            condition diet_approved_after_the_fact(x);
            window [d, infinity);
        }
    };
}

// --- Article 88: the Imperial House ----------------------------------------------
relation imperial_house_property(x: ImperialHouseProperty) kind empirical {
    label ja official "皇室財産";
    label en unofficial "the property belongs to the Imperial House";
}
relation state_property(x: ImperialHouseProperty) kind institutional {
    label ja official "国に属する";
    label en unofficial "the property belongs to the State";
}
relation imperial_house_expense_of_year(e: ImperialHouseExpense, fy: FiscalYear) kind empirical {
    label ja official "皇室の費用";
    label en unofficial "the expense of the Imperial House is incurred in the fiscal year";
}
relation expense_entered_in_budget(e: ImperialHouseExpense, b: Proposal) kind empirical {
    label ja official "予算に計上して";
    label en unofficial "the expense is entered in the budget";
}
relation imperial_expense_in_resolved_budget(e: ImperialHouseExpense) kind institutional {
    label ja official "予算に計上して国会の議決を経た";
    label en unofficial "the expense is entered in a budget of its fiscal year on which the Diet has resolved";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART88_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "すべて皇室財産は、国に属する")
rule ImperialHousePropertyBelongsToState strict {
    label ja official "すべて皇室財産は、国に属する";
    label en unofficial "Article 88, first sentence. All property of the Imperial House belongs to the State";
    for x: ImperialHouseProperty;
    when imperial_house_property(x);
    then state_property(x);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART88_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "予算に計上して国会の議決を経なければならない")
rule ImperialExpenseInResolvedBudget strict {
    label en unofficial "Expenses of the Imperial Household are entered in a budget resolved by the Diet";
    for e: ImperialHouseExpense; for b: Proposal; for fy: FiscalYear;
    when imperial_house_expense_of_year(e, fy) and expense_entered_in_budget(e, b) and budget_for_year(b, fy)
        and proposal_kind(b, pk_budget) and diet_resolution(b);
    then imperial_expense_in_resolved_budget(e);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART88_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "すべて皇室の費用は、予算に計上して国会の議決を経なければならない")
rule CabinetMustBudgetEveryImperialExpense strict {
    label ja official "すべて皇室の費用は、予算に計上して国会の議決を経なければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 88, second sentence. Every expense of the Imperial House must be entered in the budget and pass a resolution of the Diet (a duty of the Cabinet, the maker of the budget, Art. 86)";
    for e: ImperialHouseExpense; for fy: FiscalYear; for f: Date; for l: Date;
    when imperial_house_expense_of_year(e, fy) and fiscal_year_span(fy, f, l);
    then duty CabinetBudgetsImperialExpense {
        bearer Cabinet; beneficiary Diet;
        goal achievement {
            condition imperial_expense_in_resolved_budget(e);
            window [@1947-05-03, l];
        }
    };
}

// --- Article 89: public funds ------------------------------------------------------
relation disposition_by(d: PublicDisposition, o: Organ) kind empirical {
    label ja official "公金その他の公の財産を支出し、又はその利用に供する機関";
    label en unofficial "the organ disposes of public money or other public property (binds the bearer)";
}
relation disposition_to(d: PublicDisposition, r: Beneficiary) kind empirical {
    label ja official "支出又は利用の相手方";
    label en unofficial "the disposition is made to the body or enterprise";
}
relation disposition_for_use_benefit_or_maintenance(d: PublicDisposition) kind empirical {
    label ja official "使用、便益若しくは維持のため";
    label en unofficial "the disposition serves the use, benefit or maintenance of the recipient";
}
relation disposes_of_public_property(o: Organ, d: PublicDisposition) kind empirical {
    label ja official "これを支出し、又はその利用に供する";
    label en unofficial "the organ spends the money or makes the property available (the action)";
}
relation recipient_is_religious_organization(r: Beneficiary) kind empirical {
    label ja official "宗教上の組織若しくは団体";
    label en unofficial "the recipient is a religious organization or body (a classification: a fact of the case)";
}
relation charitable_educational_or_benevolent_enterprise(r: Beneficiary) kind empirical {
    label ja official "慈善、教育若しくは博愛の事業";
    label en unofficial "the recipient is a charitable, educational or benevolent enterprise";
}
// EVALUATIVE (DECISION-0194, channel 2): the text names no decider. A fact of the court or organ
// that classified the enterprise; the caller supplies it with `origin adjudicated`.
relation under_public_control(r: Beneficiary) kind empirical {
    label ja official "公の支配に属する";
    label en unofficial "the enterprise is under public control (公の支配; a fact of the court or organ, origin adjudicated; the readings are not asserted)";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART89_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "宗教上の組織若しくは団体の使用、便益若しくは維持のため")
rule NoPublicFundsForReligiousBodies strict {
    label ja official "公金その他の公の財産は、宗教上の組織若しくは団体の使用、便益若しくは維持のため、これを支出し、又はその利用に供してはならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 89, first limb. Public money or other public property may not be spent or made available for the use, benefit or maintenance of a religious organization or body";
    for o: Organ; for d: PublicDisposition; for r: Beneficiary;
    when disposition_by(d, o) and disposition_to(d, r) and recipient_is_religious_organization(r) and disposition_for_use_benefit_or_maintenance(d);
    then prohibition NoPublicFundsToReligiousBody {
        bearer o;
        action disposes_of_public_property(o, d);
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART89_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "公の支配に属しない慈善、教育若しくは博愛の事業に対し")
rule NoPublicFundsForUncontrolledEnterprises strict {
    label ja official "公金その他の公の財産は、公の支配に属しない慈善、教育若しくは博愛の事業に対し、これを支出し、又はその利用に供してはならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 89, second limb. Public money or other public property may not be spent or made available for a charitable, educational or benevolent enterprise that is not under public control";
    for o: Organ; for d: PublicDisposition; for r: Beneficiary;
    when disposition_by(d, o) and disposition_to(d, r) and charitable_educational_or_benevolent_enterprise(r)
        and not_known(under_public_control(r));
    then prohibition NoPublicFundsToUncontrolledEnterprise {
        bearer o;
        action disposes_of_public_property(o, d);
        window [@1947-05-03, infinity);
    };
}

// --- Article 90: final accounts ---------------------------------------------------
relation final_accounts_of(a: FinalAccounts, fy: FiscalYear) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国の収入支出の決算";
    label en unofficial "the final accounts of the fiscal year";
}
relation final_accounts_inspected(a: FinalAccounts) kind empirical {
    label ja official "会計検査院がこれを検査し";
    label en unofficial "the Board of Audit has inspected the final accounts";
}
relation cabinet_submits_final_accounts(a: FinalAccounts) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国会に提出する";
    label en unofficial "the Cabinet submitted the final accounts to the Diet";
}
relation audit_report_accompanies(a: FinalAccounts) kind empirical {
    label ja official "その検査報告とともに";
    label en unofficial "the audit report accompanied the submission";
}
relation final_accounts_properly_submitted(a: FinalAccounts) kind institutional {
    label ja official "検査報告とともに国会に提出した";
    label en unofficial "the final accounts were submitted to the Diet with the audit report, after inspection";
}
relation audit_of_final_accounts_window(a: FinalAccounts, s: Date, e: Date) kind institutional {
    key(a);
    label en unofficial "the window of the inspection: from the day after the fiscal year to the last day of the following fiscal year";
}
relation board_of_audit_statute_applies(o: Organ) kind empirical {
    label ja official "会計検査院の組織及び権限は、法律でこれを定める";
    label en unofficial "a statute governs the organization and powers of the Board of Audit (content external)";
}
relation board_of_audit_matters_set_by_statute(o: Organ) kind institutional {
    label ja official "会計検査院の組織及び権限";
    label en unofficial "the organization and powers of the Board of Audit are those of the statute";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART90_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "その検査報告とともに、これを国会に提出しなければならない")
rule FinalAccountsSubmittedWithReport strict {
    label en unofficial "The final accounts are properly submitted when inspected and accompanied by the audit report";
    for a: FinalAccounts;
    when cabinet_submits_final_accounts(a) and audit_report_accompanies(a) and final_accounts_inspected(a);
    then final_accounts_properly_submitted(a);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART90_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "毎年会計検査院がこれを検査し")
rule InspectionWindowOfFinalAccounts strict {
    label en unofficial "The audit window for the final accounts runs through the following fiscal year";
    for a: FinalAccounts; for fy: FiscalYear; for ny: FiscalYear; for l: Date; for f2: Date; for l2: Date;
    when final_accounts_of(a, fy) and fiscal_year_span(fy, _, l) and following_fiscal_year(fy, ny) and fiscal_year_span(ny, f2, l2);
    then audit_of_final_accounts_window(a, add_calendar_period(l, 1 calendar_day), l2);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART90_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "毎年会計検査院がこれを検査し")
rule BoardOfAuditMustInspectFinalAccountsEveryYear strict {
    label ja official "国の収入支出の決算は、すべて毎年会計検査院がこれを検査し";
    label en unofficial "Article 90(1), first limb. The final accounts of the State are inspected every year by the Board of Audit";
    for a: FinalAccounts; for s: Date; for e: Date;
    when audit_of_final_accounts_window(a, s, e);
    then duty BoardInspectsFinalAccounts {
        bearer BoardOfAudit; beneficiary Diet;
        goal achievement {
            condition final_accounts_inspected(a);
            window [s, e];
        }
    };
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART90_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "内閣は、次の年度に、その検査報告とともに、これを国会に提出しなければならない")
rule CabinetMustSubmitFinalAccountsInNextYear strict {
    label ja official "内閣は、次の年度に、その検査報告とともに、これを国会に提出しなければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 90(1), second limb. The Cabinet submits the final accounts, with the audit report, to the Diet in the next fiscal year";
    for a: FinalAccounts; for fy: FiscalYear; for ny: FiscalYear; for f2: Date; for l2: Date;
    when final_accounts_of(a, fy) and following_fiscal_year(fy, ny) and fiscal_year_span(ny, f2, l2);
    then duty CabinetSubmitsFinalAccounts {
        bearer Cabinet; beneficiary Diet;
        goal achievement {
            condition final_accounts_properly_submitted(a);
            window [f2, l2];
        }
    };
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART90_P2)
rule BoardOfAuditMattersSetByStatute strict {
    label ja official "会計検査院の組織及び権限は、法律でこれを定める";
    label en unofficial "Article 90(2). The organization and powers of the Board of Audit are fixed by statute";
    for o: Organ;
    when board_of_audit_statute_applies(o);
    then board_of_audit_matters_set_by_statute(o);
}

// --- Article 91: the report on finances ------------------------------------------
relation finance_report_made_on(d: Date) kind empirical {
    label ja official "国の財政状況についての報告";
    label en unofficial "the Cabinet reported on the financial condition of the State on the day (to the Diet and the people)";
}
relation finance_report_due(d: Date, due: Date) kind institutional {
    key(d);
    label ja official "少くとも毎年一回";
    label en unofficial "after the report of the day d the next report is due on the day due at the latest (one calendar year, the anniversary inside)";
}
relation next_finance_report_in_time(d: Date) kind institutional {
    label ja official "少くとも毎年一回報告した";
    label en unofficial "a further report was made after the day d and not later than one calendar year after it";
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART91_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "少くとも毎年一回")
rule NextFinanceReportDue strict {
    label en unofficial "The next report on the state of finances is due within one year of the previous one";
    for d: Date;
    when finance_report_made_on(d);
    then finance_report_due(d, add_calendar_period(d, 1 calendar_year));
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART91_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "少くとも毎年一回")
rule NextFinanceReportInTime strict {
    label en unofficial "The next report on finances was made within one year of the previous report";
    for d: Date; for due: Date; for x: Date;
    when finance_report_due(d, due) and finance_report_made_on(x) and x > d and x <= due;
    then next_finance_report_in_time(d);
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART91_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "国会及び国民に対し")
rule CabinetMustReportToTheDietAtLeastYearly strict {
    label ja official "内閣は、国会及び国民に対し、定期に、少くとも毎年一回、国の財政状況について報告しなければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 91. The Cabinet reports to the Diet on the finances of the State at least once a year (addressee: the Diet)";
    for d: Date; for due: Date;
    when finance_report_due(d, due);
    then duty CabinetReportsFinancesToDiet {
        bearer Cabinet; beneficiary Diet;
        goal achievement {
            condition next_finance_report_in_time(d);
            window [d, due];
        }
    };
}

@source(JP_CONST_ART91_P1, relation = formalizes, coverage = partial, quote = "国会及び国民に対し")
rule CabinetMustReportToThePeopleAtLeastYearly strict {
    label ja official "内閣は、国会及び国民に対し、定期に、少くとも毎年一回、国の財政状況について報告しなければならない";
    label en unofficial "Article 91. The Cabinet reports to the people on the finances of the State at least once a year (addressee: the people)";
    for d: Date; for due: Date;
    when finance_report_due(d, due);
    then duty CabinetReportsFinancesToPeople {
        bearer Cabinet; beneficiary ThePeople;
        goal achievement {
            condition next_finance_report_in_time(d);
            window [d, due];
        }
    };
}
